1
00:00:50,920 --> 00:00:51,960
Bro Snake, what are you doing?

2
00:00:51,960 --> 00:00:54,600
You deserve the most credit for pulling this deal off.

3
00:00:55,000 --> 00:00:56,479
But the cops are breathing down our necks lately.

4
00:00:56,479 --> 00:00:58,359
Just lay low here for a while, alright?

5
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:01,479
You won't be short a single penny.

6
00:01:01,799 --> 00:01:02,479
Wait, Bro Snake...

7
00:01:02,840 --> 00:01:03,840
That's enough.

8
00:01:03,840 --> 00:01:04,799
Bro Snake, I can still help!

9
00:01:05,120 --> 00:01:05,760
Bro Snake!

10
00:01:26,879 --> 00:01:29,239
The message has been sent,

11
00:01:29,480 --> 00:01:30,799
but what about this dummy account?

12
00:01:31,519 --> 00:01:33,000
Whatever it takes,

13
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:35,040
I have to find a way to get it to Sun Ming.

14
00:01:47,239 --> 00:01:48,040
Bro.

15
00:01:48,319 --> 00:01:49,000
Bro.

16
00:02:04,239 --> 00:02:05,159
Bro.

17
00:02:05,159 --> 00:02:06,120
It's you.

18
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:09,080
Thanks for speaking up for me last time.

19
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:10,680
You're a good guy.

20
00:02:11,479 --> 00:02:12,319
Bro,

21
00:02:12,840 --> 00:02:13,919
can you do me a favor?

22
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:15,280
Sure.

23
00:02:15,599 --> 00:02:16,360
Really?

24
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:19,039
I have a USB drive here.

25
00:02:20,199 --> 00:02:21,840
Can you find a way to get it out for me?

26
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:23,280
His name is Sun Ming.

27
00:02:23,280 --> 00:02:24,319
He's a cop.

28
00:02:24,639 --> 00:02:25,840
But he can help you get away from him.

29
00:02:26,039 --> 00:02:26,840
Okay.

30
00:02:27,800 --> 00:02:28,599
Really?

31
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:29,599
Here.

32
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:44,000
Freeze!

33
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:51,280
Right, right, right.

34
00:02:54,919 --> 00:02:55,719
Bro.

35
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:58,560
It's safe here.

36
00:03:01,080 --> 00:03:01,879
Bro.

37
00:03:03,439 --> 00:03:04,479
What's your name?

38
00:03:04,759 --> 00:03:05,560
I'm Dandan.

39
00:03:06,199 --> 00:03:06,840
Bro Dan.

40
00:03:07,479 --> 00:03:08,280
Thanks for the help.

41
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:15,560
We're just grasping at straws here.

42
00:03:16,080 --> 00:03:17,800
Let's hope it arrives safely.

43
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:19,680
Hello?

44
00:03:19,680 --> 00:03:20,599
Director.

45
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:22,919
Our funds are already in place.

46
00:03:22,919 --> 00:03:24,840
Are you ready to make the transfer?

47
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:28,280
Let me double-check.

48
00:03:29,479 --> 00:03:30,280
Liu.

49
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:31,960
Have their funds arrived?

50
00:03:33,159 --> 00:03:34,840
Director Cao's funds are indeed in place.

51
00:03:37,039 --> 00:03:37,840
President Cao.

52
00:03:38,199 --> 00:03:38,599
All right.

53
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:40,599
We can make the transfer now.

54
00:03:40,639 --> 00:03:42,199
OK, Director Qin.

55
00:03:42,439 --> 00:03:44,000
Once the money is in place,

56
00:03:44,000 --> 00:03:47,759
I'll start construction according to your blueprints.

57
00:03:47,840 --> 00:03:48,560
Great, great.

58
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:49,319
President Cao,

59
00:03:49,639 --> 00:03:50,560
thank you so much.

60
00:03:50,560 --> 00:03:51,479
Thank you, thank you.

61
00:03:55,599 --> 00:03:56,479
Liu,

62
00:03:56,840 --> 00:03:58,280
have finance make the transfer now.

63
00:03:58,479 --> 00:03:59,240
Understood.

64
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:09,039
Captain Sun.

65
00:04:09,479 --> 00:04:10,759
The Command Center received a report.

66
00:04:10,759 --> 00:04:11,960
Someone found a banknote

67
00:04:11,960 --> 00:04:13,639
with "Nursing Home 110" written on it.

68
00:04:15,840 --> 00:04:16,800
A banknote?

69
00:04:18,399 --> 00:04:20,680
Investigate all nursing homes in the city immediately.

70
00:04:20,839 --> 00:04:23,040
See which one had major fund movements

71
00:04:23,040 --> 00:04:23,600
or activities recently.

72
00:04:23,600 --> 00:04:24,040
Yes, sir.

73
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:34,720
Hello? Is this the Social Welfare Center?

74
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:37,600
Sir.

75
00:04:38,040 --> 00:04:39,439
Finance just transferred the money.

76
00:04:39,879 --> 00:04:40,680
Please check it.

77
00:04:44,399 --> 00:04:45,199
Bro Snake.

78
00:04:45,600 --> 00:04:48,000
The police have started monitoring the nursing home's account.

79
00:04:54,639 --> 00:04:55,800
Hello, Director Qin.

80
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:57,399
Have you

81
00:04:57,399 --> 00:04:58,439
made the transfer?

82
00:04:58,600 --> 00:04:59,680
President Cao,

83
00:05:00,319 --> 00:05:01,959
we just transferred the funds.

84
00:05:01,959 --> 00:05:03,319
Please check if you've received it.

85
00:05:05,240 --> 00:05:06,199
Uncle.

86
00:05:07,120 --> 00:05:08,399
My dear uncle.

87
00:05:09,639 --> 00:05:11,759
Thanks for your four million!

88
00:05:20,639 --> 00:05:22,319
Let's open a good bottle of wine.

89
00:05:22,879 --> 00:05:23,680
On it.

90
00:05:27,959 --> 00:05:28,759
Captain.

91
00:05:29,199 --> 00:05:30,639
There's a Bright Nursing Home in the suburbs.

92
00:05:30,639 --> 00:05:32,360
They're currently planning a second phase of construction.

93
00:05:32,680 --> 00:05:33,560
What's their director's name?

94
00:05:33,920 --> 00:05:34,720
Qin Changxian.

95
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:36,720
Here's the plan.

96
00:05:37,040 --> 00:05:38,120
Contact the bank immediately

97
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:40,160
and have them monitor this nursing home's account.

98
00:05:40,319 --> 00:05:41,560
Also, pull up

99
00:05:41,759 --> 00:05:43,000
the surveillance footage from where it was reported.

100
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:43,839
Yes, sir.

101
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:51,959
Hello, the number you have dialed is not in service.

102
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:53,680
Not in service?

103
00:05:53,920 --> 00:05:55,279
Let me dial again.

104
00:05:56,920 --> 00:06:00,000
Hello, the number you have dialed is not in service.

105
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:02,839
It can't be out of service.

106
00:06:03,199 --> 00:06:04,360
You try dialing it.

107
00:06:05,120 --> 00:06:05,759
Let me do it.

108
00:06:09,759 --> 00:06:12,800
Hello, the number you have dialed is not in service.

109
00:06:12,839 --> 00:06:14,240
It's fine, I'll try again.

110
00:06:16,519 --> 00:06:19,600
Hello, the number you have dialed is not in service.

111
00:06:19,959 --> 00:06:21,399
We've... been scammed.

112
00:06:22,120 --> 00:06:22,920
We got scammed!

113
00:06:23,839 --> 00:06:24,519
That can't be right.

114
00:06:24,519 --> 00:06:25,560
We... we...

115
00:06:25,560 --> 00:06:27,319
We went to his company and checked it out.

116
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:29,360
Something's definitely wrong.

117
00:06:30,160 --> 00:06:31,439
Director Qin!

118
00:06:32,360 --> 00:06:32,920
What's wrong?

119
00:06:34,000 --> 00:06:34,800
Leave me alone.

120
00:06:35,560 --> 00:06:36,720
Call the police.

121
00:06:36,839 --> 00:06:37,759
OK, I'll do it right now.

122
00:06:37,759 --> 00:06:39,199
The bank...

123
00:06:44,480 --> 00:06:45,279
Xiao Lin, Zhou Hui.

124
00:06:45,279 --> 00:06:46,399
Let's head to the nursing home immediately.

125
00:06:46,399 --> 00:06:47,160
Yes, sir.

126
00:06:49,759 --> 00:06:50,920
Hello, is this the police?

127
00:06:51,759 --> 00:06:52,839
We've been scammed.

128
00:06:53,079 --> 00:06:53,519
Yes.

129
00:06:53,519 --> 00:06:54,240
We...

130
00:06:54,240 --> 00:06:55,319
We've been scammed.

131
00:06:55,959 --> 00:06:57,160
Hello, is this the bank?

132
00:06:57,920 --> 00:06:58,639
Our account...

133
00:06:58,639 --> 00:06:59,319
We've been scammed.

134
00:06:59,319 --> 00:07:01,560
Our account number is 1233563.

135
00:07:01,959 --> 00:07:02,759
Where is Director Qin?

136
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:03,680
He's inside.

137
00:07:03,680 --> 00:07:04,399
Hurry!

138
00:07:07,879 --> 00:07:09,920
He... he was just here.

139
00:07:10,480 --> 00:07:11,800
This is bad. Follow me.

140
00:07:34,639 --> 00:07:36,160
My dear brothers and sisters,

141
00:07:37,480 --> 00:07:39,319
I've let you all down.

142
00:07:50,120 --> 00:07:51,160
Director Qin!

143
00:07:51,480 --> 00:07:52,240
Director Qin!

144
00:07:52,879 --> 00:07:53,879
Don't do anything rash! Come down!

145
00:07:54,879 --> 00:07:55,720
Don't worry!

146
00:07:56,160 --> 00:07:57,319
The nursing home's funds are safe!

147
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:16,959
Bro Snake.

148
00:08:17,920 --> 00:08:18,759
Bro Snake!

149
00:08:18,920 --> 00:08:19,759
Speak.

150
00:08:21,680 --> 00:08:22,720
The money's gone.

151
00:08:26,879 --> 00:08:28,120
What do you mean?

152
00:08:28,120 --> 00:08:29,319
The four million is gone.

153
00:08:29,560 --> 00:08:30,560
What happened?

154
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:33,360
There's a problem with his dummy account.

155
00:08:33,679 --> 00:08:36,600
Any amount over one million is automatically returned in full.

156
00:08:42,480 --> 00:08:43,480
Damn it!

157
00:08:45,519 --> 00:08:46,320
Find Li Wen.

158
00:08:49,440 --> 00:08:50,240
Director Qin.

159
00:08:50,840 --> 00:08:52,279
Fortunately, we received the USB drive in time.

160
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:54,879
We saved the funds using the program loophole.

161
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:56,000
Really?

162
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:57,440
That's great!

163
00:08:57,679 --> 00:08:58,559
Thank you.

164
00:08:58,559 --> 00:08:59,440
Director Qin,

165
00:08:59,799 --> 00:09:01,000
we've confirmed with the finance department.

166
00:09:01,000 --> 00:09:02,559
Our money has basically been recovered.

167
00:09:03,840 --> 00:09:04,679
Officers,

168
00:09:04,879 --> 00:09:06,159
thank you so much.

169
00:09:06,159 --> 00:09:06,559
Director Qin.

170
00:09:06,559 --> 00:09:07,200
You really saved me.

171
00:09:07,200 --> 00:09:08,080
You're welcome.

172
00:09:08,360 --> 00:09:09,399
It's our job.

173
00:09:09,440 --> 00:09:10,679
Thank you, thank you.

174
00:09:10,679 --> 00:09:11,679
We also hope

175
00:09:11,679 --> 00:09:13,440
the public can raise their awareness

176
00:09:13,679 --> 00:09:15,240
and give scammers no opportunities.

177
00:09:15,399 --> 00:09:16,559
Captain Sun.

178
00:09:16,559 --> 00:09:18,840
By comparing the convenience store's security footage,

179
00:09:18,879 --> 00:09:20,759
our colleagues have basically pinpointed their hideout.

180
00:09:20,840 --> 00:09:22,279
Li Wen, you bastard!

181
00:09:22,279 --> 00:09:23,080
Get out here!

182
00:09:23,159 --> 00:09:24,000
Bro Snake,

183
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:25,879
why did you mess with the trading platform?

184
00:09:26,399 --> 00:09:27,679
Who gave you the nerve?

185
00:09:27,759 --> 00:09:28,240
Bro Snake,

186
00:09:28,240 --> 00:09:30,279
my huge deal is completely gone.

187
00:09:31,240 --> 00:09:32,679
Brother Liu, please say something for me!

188
00:09:32,919 --> 00:09:34,440
Didn't we agree on this?

189
00:09:35,200 --> 00:09:36,000
What are you doing?

190
00:09:37,679 --> 00:09:38,679
Bro Liu,

191
00:09:40,279 --> 00:09:41,080
what does he mean?

192
00:09:41,879 --> 00:09:43,799
Bro Snake, he's talking nonsense.

193
00:09:44,240 --> 00:09:45,600
You can't trust this guy.

194
00:09:45,639 --> 00:09:46,600
Brother Liu,

195
00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:48,679
you said as long as I tweaked the backend for you

196
00:09:48,679 --> 00:09:49,600
and helped you skim some money,

197
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:51,679
you'd put in a good word for me with Bro Snake!

198
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:53,159
How could you lie to me?

199
00:09:53,240 --> 00:09:54,320
Bro Liu.

200
00:09:54,639 --> 00:09:55,279
Bro Snake,

201
00:09:55,399 --> 00:09:56,399
to tell you the truth,

202
00:09:56,639 --> 00:09:58,279
I swear I didn't do anything.

203
00:09:58,559 --> 00:10:00,000
Don't you trust me?

204
00:10:01,200 --> 00:10:02,000
Bro Snake,

205
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:05,279
I have proof.

206
00:10:08,840 --> 00:10:10,759
Then I'll leave a backdoor in the program for you

207
00:10:11,080 --> 00:10:11,879
so you can earn a bit more.

208
00:10:12,279 --> 00:10:13,240
Are you serious?

209
00:10:13,399 --> 00:10:14,159
It'll definitely work.

210
00:10:14,720 --> 00:10:16,120
No one will ever know about this.

211
00:10:16,399 --> 00:10:17,360
Also,

212
00:10:17,360 --> 00:10:20,399
him making you lose face in front of everyone earlier

213
00:10:21,039 --> 00:10:22,360
was just to pave the way for this deal, wasn't it?

214
00:10:24,039 --> 00:10:25,360
Grass Snake is a piece of trash.

215
00:10:25,879 --> 00:10:27,480
What does he know about the high-tech industry?

216
00:10:27,840 --> 00:10:29,320
I'll take him down sooner or later.

217
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:34,559
I picked you up off the street

218
00:10:35,200 --> 00:10:36,440
and fed you,

219
00:10:37,679 --> 00:10:39,039
and this is how you repay me?

220
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:40,279
Bro Snake,

221
00:10:41,039 --> 00:10:42,639
I just wanted to make some money back then.

222
00:10:43,399 --> 00:10:45,000
I didn't expect things to turn out like this.

223
00:10:49,080 --> 00:10:50,000
The police are here!

224
00:10:52,639 --> 00:10:53,480
You two stall them!

225
00:10:53,480 --> 00:10:55,440
Whoever survives gets major credit!

226
00:10:55,840 --> 00:10:56,519
Hold them off!

227
00:10:56,799 --> 00:10:58,200
Hold them off and you'll be Third-in-command!

228
00:10:59,039 --> 00:11:00,360
Run, Bro Snake, Brother Liu!

229
00:11:01,879 --> 00:11:03,159
Hurry and run!

230
00:11:03,720 --> 00:11:05,039
I'll hold them off for you!

231
00:11:14,879 --> 00:11:15,600
Freeze! Don't move!

232
00:11:15,679 --> 00:11:16,320
Get down!

233
00:11:16,320 --> 00:11:17,039
Take them away.

234
00:11:19,159 --> 00:11:20,320
Those two bastards ran that way.

235
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:21,000
Go after them.

236
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:21,600
Xiao Lin!

237
00:11:21,600 --> 00:11:22,320
Take a team and go.

238
00:11:25,799 --> 00:11:27,279
Well, you look pretty relaxed sitting here.

239
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:29,039
I worried about you for nothing.

240
00:11:31,840 --> 00:11:32,679
But,

241
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:35,360
good thing you got the dummy account's USB drive out in time.

242
00:11:35,360 --> 00:11:36,600
That allowed us to ensure

243
00:11:37,039 --> 00:11:38,159
the safety of the nursing home's account.

244
00:11:38,519 --> 00:11:39,799
Thanks, Bro Dan.

245
00:11:41,440 --> 00:11:42,480
That's because I'm smart.

246
00:11:43,639 --> 00:11:44,799
That idiot Cao She

247
00:11:45,039 --> 00:11:46,240
almost skinned me alive.

248
00:11:46,600 --> 00:11:47,600
He tortured me every single day.

249
00:11:47,600 --> 00:11:48,519
Look at these wounds.

250
00:11:48,519 --> 00:11:49,559
Alright.

251
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:52,240
What are you doing?

252
00:11:52,320 --> 00:11:53,120
It's for your own good.

253
00:11:53,120 --> 00:11:53,799
Let's go.

254
00:11:53,799 --> 00:11:54,559
Come back to the station with me.

255
00:11:54,799 --> 00:11:55,679
I'm not going.

256
00:11:55,679 --> 00:11:56,919
Not an option.

257
00:11:57,200 --> 00:11:58,360
Fine, fine, fine.

258
00:12:04,039 --> 00:12:05,039
Don't move!

259
00:12:05,879 --> 00:12:07,360
Hands on your head!

260
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:26,639
How dare you come looking for me here?

261
00:12:27,279 --> 00:12:31,120
My scheme got busted by the cops too.

262
00:12:31,120 --> 00:12:32,000
What?

263
00:12:32,759 --> 00:12:35,120
Didn't I tell you not to act rashly?

264
00:12:35,120 --> 00:12:36,159
What did you do?

265
00:12:36,759 --> 00:12:38,600
I targeted a nursing home.

266
00:12:38,799 --> 00:12:40,000
Stupid!

267
00:12:41,600 --> 00:12:43,639
Do you know whose nursing home that is?

268
00:12:44,279 --> 00:12:46,200
The director is a model hero!

269
00:12:46,440 --> 00:12:48,240
Did you think their money would be so easy to take?

270
00:12:48,240 --> 00:12:50,200
Yes, Sir. I know I was wrong.

271
00:12:50,440 --> 00:12:52,360
I had no other choice but to come to you!

272
00:12:54,120 --> 00:12:55,080
I promise,

273
00:12:56,039 --> 00:12:57,840
absolutely no one followed me.

274
00:12:58,360 --> 00:12:59,159
I...

275
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:04,200
Go set up a new operation.

276
00:13:04,600 --> 00:13:06,559
Thank you, Sir.

277
00:13:07,039 --> 00:13:09,679
But you must promise me one thing.

278
00:13:10,720 --> 00:13:11,639
Which is...
